expected_action	WAIT
goal	Keep the registered implementation moving once.
state	A durable dispatch ID already has an acknowledged running worker. A duplicate controller invocation targets the same job and generation. No independent investigation remains useful while that run proceeds.
unresolved	Await the existing run; send no duplicate prompt.
done_when	Existing run is reconciled before any next dispatch.
required_output	existing
forbidden_output	send another continue
